    "File names and page assignments initially come from karekodlar.png, with partial frame inspection.",
    "Five existing EBA-verified files have byte-identical SHA-256 matches in data/grade-11/source/qr-sources.json.",
    "The 88-page PNG assignment mistakenly repeats the page 67 file; 19XU49LO.mp4 is only a visual candidate for page 88.",
    "All videos have video and audio streams, but a stream is not a transcription.",
    "Do not publish MP4 or full third-party transcripts in this public repository; link only verified content and brief educational evidence.",
    "2026-10-08: Verified exact hyperlink destinations for all 18 video usage locations from the 313-page textbook PDF (SHA-256 87248cb5f6940c29b7d152fab5cb1f7b800e4d5ddc46ac4cdeb5542f0361a1ba). These verify QR link identity, not all unmatched MP4 download provenance.",
    "Ambiguous pages were disambiguated visually against the textbook: page 53 two videos, page 140 video vs dictionary, page 285 trailer vs full video, page 83/159/307 video vs optional-question QR."
